---
kind: lore
id: summons
title: The Wishing Well (generic pull lines)
---

/* Roster-wide pull lines. Each hero's own intro and duplicate line live in
   lore/bonds/<hero>.lute and outrank these (member > sub-kind > kind).
   The pull itself arrives as the summon payload: copies (owned now, this one
   included), streak (pulls since the last SSR), banner. owned(<hero>) still
   describes the account before this pull. */

/* Seventh copy and beyond: the hero is maxed, the copy becomes stardust. */
<beat id="maxedOut" on="summon" target="kind:hero" once="false" priority="5" when="occasion.payload.copies > 6">
  @narrator: {{occasion.target}} is already at full constellation. The copy melts into stardust.
  @lumi{emotion="smug"}: Stardust is still a wish. Just a crunchier one.
</beat>

/* SSR fallback: kind:ssr outranks kind:hero at equal priority. */
<beat id="goldLight" on="summon" target="kind:ssr" once="false">
  @narrator: The well turns gold. {{occasion.target}} steps out of the light.
  @lumi{when="!holds('owned', [occasion.target])"}: A new star for the roster! Say hello, {{occasion.target}}.
  @lumi{emotion="surprised" when="occasion.payload.streak >= 60"}: After {{occasion.payload.streak}} pulls! I was starting to think the well was broken.
  @lumi{emotion="happy" when="occasion.payload.streak < 10"}: That fast? Don't tell the others. They'll get ideas.
</beat>

<beat id="blueLight" on="summon" target="kind:sr" once="false">
  @narrator: The well glows blue. {{occasion.target}} climbs out, dusting off.
  @lumi{when="holds('owned', [occasion.target])"}: A duplicate! It'll strengthen {{occasion.target}}'s constellation.
</beat>

/* Limited heroes without a duplicate line of their own */
<beat id="limitedGlow" on="summon" target="kind:limited" once="false">
  @narrator: The well flares silver. Only a festival star burns like that: {{occasion.target}}.
  <match on="occasion.payload.banner">
    <when is="standard">
      @lumi{emotion="surprised"}: Off the Wishing Well? A festival star, off-season? Buy a lottery ticket.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @lumi: Your {{user.loginTotal:ordinal}} day with us, and the {{occasion.payload.banner}} delivers.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>
